      "text": "On New Year's Eve, the Delhi Traffic Police will not allow any vehicular traffic in the inner, middle or outer circle of Connaught Place from 7 pm on Wednesday (December 31), to prevent jams and allow seamless celebrations, Delhi Police said in its traffic advisory.\n\nRead Here: https://t.co/N6v8JBXfC1\n\n#DNAUpdates | #NewYear | #DelhiTraffic",
